# Beat waits: the event arrives at the next whole beat, numbered by
# the main clock, so beats missed while busy show as a jump. Stop or
# close ends a wait with STOPPED. Cancel disarms it. Not playing:
# an error at once (the glue returns empty).
open virtual
arm
  error: SEQ_ERR_NOT_PLAYING (not playing)
track 1 60:1
  takes over at beat 0.000 (t0)
play continue
  was playing: 0
beatwait
  armed (id 1)
  event: BEAT 0 (id 1)
beatwait
  armed (id 2)
  event: BEAT 1 (id 2)
runto 5.5
beatwait
  armed (id 3)
  event: BEAT 6 (id 3)
arm
  armed (id 4)
cancel
runto 9
arm
  armed (id 5)
arm
  armed (id 6)
runto 10.5
  event: BEAT 9 (id 6)
arm
  armed (id 7)
play stop
  was playing: 1
  event: STOPPED OK (id 7)
play continue
  was playing: 0
arm
  armed (id 8)
close
  closed: 1
  event: STOPPED OK (id 8)
